"""Editorial question designs for consciousness, digital remains, and synthetic cells."""

from review_angle_plans import audit, revise_domain


CONSCIOUS = """history_origins|Machine Consciousness Debates|How did philosophical tests and AI research frame the question?|Trace dated primary works.
famous_examples|A Sentience Claim about an AI|What behavior was shown and which inference was disputed?|Use transcript and expert analysis.
hidden_stories|People behind the Consciousness Debate|Whose labor and affected users disappear when a system is personified?|Identify real stakeholders.
beginner_explainers|Intelligence, Simulation, Experience|What is each claim and what evidence could bear on it?|Avoid treating fluent text as experience.
advanced_concepts|Indicators of Machine Consciousness|How do competing theories generate different proposed tests?|State assumptions and limits.
mysteries_unsolved_cases|Can Subjective Experience Be Detected?|What observations could discriminate theories?|Admit unresolved measurement problem.
technology_innovation|A New AI Architecture|Does a technical change satisfy a proposed indicator?|Examine system details and uncertainty.
people_personalities|A Researcher's Position|What definition and evidence underpin a named view?|Read original argument and critics.
major_events|A Public AI Sentience Dispute|How did claims, evidence, and institutional response unfold?|Build dated record.
how_it_works|From Behavior to Consciousness Claim|Which inferential steps link output to possible experience?|Expose alternatives.
rise_fall|A Proposed Test Challenged|Which counterexample or replication weakened confidence?|Compare theory and evidence.
then_vs_now|Consciousness Claims across AI Generations|Which capabilities changed and which epistemic problem stayed?|Use comparable tasks.
future_developments|If an AI Met Some Indicators|What follow-up evidence and safeguards would be needed?|Frame conditional scenario.
myths_vs_facts|A Chatbot Says It Feels?|Why does first-person wording alone fail to establish experience?|Examine training and prompts.
documentary_stories|One Claim's Evidence Trail|Who observed what, when, and with which independent check?|Separate testimony and proof.
assumption_inventory|A Conscious-AI Scenario|Which theory, architecture, and test assumptions are necessary?|Label philosophical uncertainty.
readiness_check|Before Declaring Consciousness|Are definitions, tests, alternative explanations, and experts explicit?|Review evidence quality.
physical_limits|Computation and Embodiment|Which theories require recurrent processing, world models, or bodies?|Do not assume one theory settled.
governance_choice|How to Handle Uncertainty|What precaution is proportionate without erasing human responsibilities?|Compare policy options.
unequal_futures|Human Harms of Personification|Who may be manipulated or denied accountability by consciousness claims?|Assess users and workers.
scenario_pair|Two Competing Consciousness Theories|How would they evaluate the same AI architecture?|Hold observed behavior fixed.
failure_to_launch|A Consciousness Metric That Failed|Did a measure classify obvious counterexamples?|Test validity.
unintended_effect|Calling a System a Person|Could the label change trust, attachment, or liability?|Measure real interaction.
social_adaptation|Living with Uncertain AI Status|How do users and institutions adapt to ambiguity?|Use bounded scenarios.
ethical_boundary|Uncertainty and Potential Welfare|When should possible machine welfare matter in decisions?|State thresholds and human effects.
signal_vs_hype|Evidence versus Sentient Headline|Which observations go beyond compelling conversation?|Use proposed indicators cautiously.
reversible_steps|Precaution without Certainty|Which deployment choices can be revised as evidence changes?|Name review triggers.
field_human_agency|Humans Retain Responsibility|Who can contest decisions justified by AI personhood?|Map accountability.
field_body_and_identity|Does a Machine Have a Self?|Which continuity or embodiment claims are testable?|Separate metaphor from evidence.
field_rights_framework|Current Law and Hypothetical AI Rights|What law applies today and what remains proposed?|Specify jurisdiction and date.
field_resource_inequality|Costs of Consciousness Research|Who pays for compute and who benefits from findings?|Use funding records.
field_institutional_adaptation|An Agency Facing a Sentience Claim|What review, disclosure, and appeal process could it use?|Keep scenario conditional.
"""

